problem:
Problem description
- There is a finite product set $$\mathcal{P}$$ and a planning horizon $$\mathcal{T}$$ indexed by periods $$t$$.
- There is a finite machine set $$\mathcal{M}$$, and each product $$p\in\mathcal{P}$$ is assigned to a designated machine $$\mu_p\in\mathcal{M}$$.
- Two distinguished products, $$p^{\mathrm{A}}$$ and $$p^{\mathrm{B}}$$, belong to $$\mathcal{P}$$ and are linked by a technical production-mix rule.
- Each product $$p\in\mathcal{P}$$ earns unit profit $$\pi_p$$ when sold and requires processing time $$\tau_p$$ per unit on its designated machine.
- The available effective machine time for machine $$m\in\mathcal{M}$$ in period $$t\in\mathcal{T}$$ is limited by capacity parameter $$H_{m,t}$$.
- A minimum mix requirement connects $$p^{\mathrm{A}}$$ and $$p^{\mathrm{B}}$$ through ratio parameters $$\alpha$$ and $$\beta$$, meaning the quantity of $$p^{\mathrm{B}}$$ produced must be kept at or above the required minimum proportion relative to the quantity of $$p^{\mathrm{A}}$$ produced.
- No explicit external demand limit is given; the plan determines how much of each product to produce and sell within the available capacities and technical rules.
- The planning goal is to maximize total profit over the full horizon.
- Required business constraints:
  - Production on each machine in each period must not exceed the effective available machine time.
  - The technical mix rule between $$p^{\mathrm{A}}$$ and $$p^{\mathrm{B}}$$ must hold throughout the plan.
  - Production quantities must be nonnegative.
  - If the implementation uses discrete units, production quantities should be integral.
- A solution is represented by:
  - $$x_{p,t}$$: quantity of product $$p$$ produced and sold in period $$t$$.
  - $$Z$$: total profit over the planning horizon.

Input Format
{
  "sets": {
    "P": {
      "description": "Set of products indexed by $$p$$."
    },
    "T": {
      "description": "Set of planning periods indexed by $$t$$."
    },
    "M": {
      "description": "Set of machines indexed by $$m$$."
    },
    "pA": {
      "description": "Distinguished product corresponding to $$A$$."
    },
    "pB": {
      "description": "Distinguished product corresponding to $$B$$."
    }
  },
  "parameters": {
    "pi": {
      "description": "Unit profit of each product $$p$$.",
      "shape": "$$|\\mathcal{P}|$$"
    },
    "tau": {
      "description": "Processing time per unit of each product $$p$$ on its designated machine.",
      "shape": "$$|\\mathcal{P}|$$"
    },
    "H": {
      "description": "Available effective machine time for machine $$m$$ in period $$t$$.",
      "shape": "$$|\\mathcal{M}|\\times|\\mathcal{T}|$$"
    },
    "mu": {
      "description": "Designated machine used by each product $$p$$.",
      "shape": "$$|\\mathcal{P}|$$"
    },
    "alpha": {
      "description": "Minimum base quantity in the technical mix rule for product $$p^{\\mathrm{A}}$$.",
      "type": "scalar"
    },
    "beta": {
      "description": "Minimum accompanying quantity in the technical mix rule for product $$p^{\\mathrm{B}}$$.",
      "type": "scalar"
    }
  },
  "demand_data": {
    "d": {
      "description": "Optional demand limit for product $$p$$ in period $$t$$; if omitted, demand is not externally capped.",
      "shape": "$$|\\mathcal{P}|\\times|\\mathcal{T}|$$"
    }
  },
  "costs": {
    "c": {
      "description": "Optional separate unit cost of product $$p$$ if the model distinguishes cost from profit; not required in the base instance.",
      "shape": "$$|\\mathcal{P}|$$"
    }
  },
  "decision_variables": {
    "x": {
      "description": "Quantity of product $$p$$ produced and sold in period $$t$$.",
      "shape": "$$|\\mathcal{P}|\\times|\\mathcal{T}|$$"
    }
  }
}

Output Format
{
  "production_plan": {
    "x": {
      "description": "Production and sales quantities $$x_{p,t}$$ for all products and periods.",
      "shape": "$$|\\mathcal{P}|\\times|\\mathcal{T}|$$"
    }
  },
  "objective_value": {
    "Z": {
      "description": "Maximum total profit achieved by the plan.",
      "type": "scalar"
    }
  }
}

Example(s)

Input 1
{
  "products": ["A", "B"],
  "planning_periods": ["week_1"],
  "machines": ["assembly_machine"],
  "unit_profit": {
    "A": 3,
    "B": 5
  },
  "processing_time_minutes": {
    "A": 12,
    "B": 25
  },
  "available_effective_machine_time_minutes": {
    "assembly_machine": {
      "week_1": 1800
    }
  },
  "designated_machine": {
    "A": "assembly_machine",
    "B": "assembly_machine"
  },
  "technical_mix_rule": {
    "base_product": "A",
    "support_product": "B",
    "base_quantity": 5,
    "support_min_quantity": 2
  }
}
